  "guidance": "Use official guidance to plan compatible updates for each affected installation. Check interpreter compatibility before applying package fixes. Upgrade pip separately: updating standalone certifi does not replace pip's vendored bundle. Review Node installations against a supported release line; embedded-root presence does not prove active trust. For system/Homebrew bundles, use vendor trust-store updates and re-audit; no macOS fixed version is asserted."
